{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-01_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-01","title":"僵局","storyCode":"6-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5f5fdccf0a55523708b231a0ac681cb774ccacb0a93121d4824d0e9a5df07630","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"937年\n埃里克勳爵與匹斯堡議會大學李爾蘭·D教授於城邦史標準論刊（《我們從哪裡來？》，44期）發表了合著論文。\n論文聲稱，據多具已風化遺骸的鑑定結果。\n薩爾貢四號填埋窟的考察已得出關鍵性結論，即感染者的隔離和處決無疑與實在法同源。\n......\n綜上所述，感染者受難的歷史，自法律出現的時候就已經開始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_f"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門，基礎支撐層，出口"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你們要和我戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們戰勝我，有人能夠僥倖活著——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我願意加入羅德島，依你們的想法去對抗感染者共同的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我必須承擔的責任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"8:50AM  龍門奪回近衛局大樓4小時後 近銅鐘出口處"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門近衛局 暨 羅德島製藥公司\n龍門圍剿行動 最後環節\n1：控制整合運動在龍門中的行動範圍。由龍門近衛局主導完成。\n2：消滅龍門中殘餘的整合運動小隊。由龍門近衛局主導完成。\n3：保證消滅整合運動行動指揮官或使其徹底失去影響力。由龍門近衛局主導完成。\n4：在整合運動撤入貧民區之前，消滅整合運動。由龍門近衛局與羅德島合作完成。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"“......請各位市民注意......正在進行疏散演習......”\n“......沒有隨行動指示進行避難的市民，請鎖緊門窗，拉好窗簾，不要隨意走出家門......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吵死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把那個無人機射下來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就只是個演習對象而已？居然想用這種把戲這種說辭，把我辛苦製造出的恐怖完全掩蓋掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"還敢用龍門語播一遍，烏薩斯語播一遍，又播一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"別被無人機干擾，走，都走！快點，避開主幹道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"偵查小隊三號也沒消息了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"突，突擊手的信號都消失了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"周邊保障小隊的聯絡通道在一個接一個地斷線！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"可恨，可惡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這種侮辱......這是對整合運動的羞辱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣，怎麼會這樣？該死的龍門，該死的龍門人！該死的非感染者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（我從沒見過他這樣，他似乎很不安。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（浮士德，我們還有機會撤離嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（我給你們創造空間。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果對手只有普通警力和龍門近衛局，以及羅德島，我們一定能安全撤退。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼意思？你是說，除了這些還有別的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"煩死了......煩死了！根本說不通！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"跟不上我指揮的隊伍，我要怎麼樣才能贏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（有人在監視我們。這座城市裡有其它東西。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（做好準備，為了生存。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（明白。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（......浮士德。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（我們相信你。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"narration","text":"9:20AM 近龍門近衛局某處 羅德島行動小隊預計巡邏點"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這種事情居然也要感染者去做？羅德島這回還真是接了個惡毒的活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龍門。哼，龍門，這麼大的城市怎麼可能沒有自己對抗入侵勢力的手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓感染者協助普通人對抗感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了，反正也不是第一次了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"快點幹掉攔路的！身後的別管，突破他們的防禦就行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"只要穿過這條街，我們就有機會和第二大隊會合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"別給他們反擊的機會，我們已經沒剩下多少人了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在沒剩下多少人，一會兒可就一個都不剩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......什麼人！從天上掉下來了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"退後，都退後！她可能......她可能會飛行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個真不會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"識別碼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你用儀器掃一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（不好意思，我先和他們說點事！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門警員，聽好！我是羅德島的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別射擊，我沒心思再邊打架邊處理流矢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡交給我一個人就行，你們趕緊去下處封鎖點吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，現在來解決我們這邊的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"這個女人什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我解釋一下你們應該就懂了，大概？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸一口氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來自羅德島的精英幹員，煌。我的作戰目標是讓各位失去戰鬥能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不管各位是抱著什麼樣的心態入侵他國城邦，我們都只以解除各位的武裝為首要目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不論各位對他人人身造成的傷害、損失以及事後的刑罰，至少，各位現在的抵抗沒有任何意義。放下武器，你們還有機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什麼？你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"同是感染者，給你們一條路選吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻投降的話，我有資格抓你們去羅德島，然後丟去個對感染者還算寬容的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"赤手空拳就擋下來了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你們反抗了，我就沒什麼話可說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們難道就該乖乖被你抓住嗎？你有毛病吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有！反抗是正當的，逃跑也是，這我完全贊成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過當你們開始反抗，我就必須用暴力回應你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛這樣吧，我不用電鋸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，真不想對同胞動手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......龍門的天氣好潮濕啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這隻傻貓......在施術！她的身上在冒熱氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身上冒熱氣？猜錯了。再猜猜看，是我身邊的空氣更熱，還是你身邊的空氣更熱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"一起洗個薩米澡吧，我請。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["警員"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["整合運動成員","煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]}]}
